# 0.1.4 — keep the build context tiny.
#
# Without this file Docker bundles the entire folder (including runtime state,
# previous node_modules, accidentally-dropped tarballs etc.) and ships it to
# the daemon — context transfer scales linearly with size and can balloon to
# multiple GB if anything large slips into the folder.

# Runtime state — mounted as a volume in compose, never needs to be in the image.
data/

# Dependencies — installed inside the image during build.
node_modules/

# Build artifacts / deploy bundles — should never end up inside the image.
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip

# Version control + editor cruft.
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Docs aren't needed at runtime.
README.md
LICENSE
*.md

# OS junk.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test / dev scratch files.
*.test.js
*.spec.js
__tests__/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
